<html class="djot-viewer"><head><meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark"><title>Diagrams</title></head><body><main class="djot"><section id="Diagrams">
<h1>Diagrams</h1>
<p>A flowchart:</p>
<pre><code class="language-mermaid">graph LR
  A[Start] --&gt; B{Choice}
  B --&gt;|yes| C[One]
  B --&gt;|no| D[Other]
</code></pre>
<p>A sequence diagram:</p>
<pre><code class="language-mermaid">sequenceDiagram
  Alice-&gt;&gt;Bob: Hello
  Bob--&gt;&gt;Alice: Hi
</code></pre>
<p>A diagram with a syntax error:</p>
<pre><code class="language-mermaid">graph LR
  A --&gt;
</code></pre>
<p>A diagram whose label contains HTML, whose onerror handler must not run:</p>
<pre><code class="language-mermaid">graph LR
  A["&lt;img src=x onerror=alert(1)&gt;"] --&gt; B
</code></pre>
</section>
</main></body></html>
